<%# Mounts the live-filter controller over a whole list region. The search input and the row
    targets it hides have to sit under one controller element, so the caller renders its search
    card and its table inside this block.

    Lists that search on the server do not need it — shared/_list_search mounts its own
    controller on the form there. %>
<div data-controller="live-filter">
  <%= yield %>
</div>
